WEBVTT

00:07.210 --> 00:09.250
<b>Huh? Where is everyone?</b>

00:11.830 --> 00:13.670
<b>You didn't tell them?!</b>

00:13.790 --> 00:15.540
<b>I thought they heard!</b>

00:33.420 --> 00:38.130
<b>On the way back from our workplace visit,
we got split up from the rest of the group.</b>

00:38.750 --> 00:40.960
<b>Sorry, I...</b>

00:41.830 --> 00:44.460
<b>No worries, the next train will be here soon.</b>

00:44.460 --> 00:46.170
<b>It's not like we're in a rush.</b>

00:46.460 --> 00:48.500
<b>Or lost or anything...</b>

00:48.500 --> 00:50.540
<b>Hey! Quit smiling you idiot!</b>

00:50.540 --> 00:52.540
<b>Quit feeling like you lucked out-</b>

00:56.250 --> 00:58.710
<b>Local              6 Cars        Hiyoshi</b>

00:56.250 --> 00:58.710
<b>Please refrain from using your cell phone while walking.</b>

00:58.790 --> 01:01.130
<b>N-next one is in seven minutes.</b>

01:01.420 --> 01:02.960
<b>Let's take a seat.</b>

01:05.580 --> 01:07.880
<b>I'm the only one who feels like they lucked out, here.</b>

01:08.000 --> 01:11.580
<b>I bet she's embarrassed getting stuck here with just me.</b>

01:11.710 --> 01:13.330
<b>That's probably why she's crying.</b>

01:16.000 --> 01:18.040
<b>Go on, nothing to see here!</b>

01:18.290 --> 01:20.630
<b>It must look like I made her cry.</b>

01:21.670 --> 01:23.670
<b>I guess, maybe I did.</b>

01:42.210 --> 01:46.000
<b>No big deal if we buy just a drink, right?</b>

01:45.460 --> 01:46.290
<b>Milk Tea</b>

01:47.580 --> 01:48.920
<b>Milk Tea</b>

01:54.000 --> 01:55.960
<b>Milk Tea</b>

02:03.630 --> 02:04.920
<b>That won't do it, huh?</b>

02:05.420 --> 02:09.880
<b>You know, it was my fault for going to the bathroom.</b>

02:09.880 --> 02:14.250
<b>I should have just announced
it to everyone or something.</b>

02:17.210 --> 02:20.750
<b>This I pledge!
I will now make my way to the bathroom!</b>

02:24.500 --> 02:26.130
<b>Like some declaration?</b>

02:27.500 --> 02:28.540
<b>Talk about distance!</b>

04:12.920 --> 04:19.500
<b>I have no idea how well known of a model Yamada is...</b>

04:20.380 --> 04:25.040
<b>But, there might be people here who recognize her...</b>

04:28.380 --> 04:32.210
<b>Musashi Koyama. Musashi Koyama.</b>

04:39.580 --> 04:41.540
<b>We'll get split up again!</b>

04:45.250 --> 04:48.670
<b>Hara's group got to go to Nagasaki Hut.</b>

04:48.670 --> 04:49.630
<b>Lucky them.</b>

04:50.080 --> 04:53.380
<b>I mean, they might not get to eat there.</b>

04:53.630 --> 04:56.960
<b>I thought this was fun enough myself.</b>

04:56.960 --> 04:58.330
<b>Especially now!</b>

04:58.710 --> 04:59.630
<b>Me too!</b>

05:00.880 --> 05:03.460
<b>Think those two are gonna go out?</b>

05:06.210 --> 05:07.330
<b>Beats me.</b>

05:07.580 --> 05:10.380
<b>Pretty crazy dating someone from the same class, huh?</b>

05:10.710 --> 05:11.830
<b>Yeah...</b>

05:12.170 --> 05:15.880
<b>I remember kids forming couples
back in elementary school.</b>

05:16.040 --> 05:17.580
<b>Always holding hands.</b>

05:19.960 --> 05:25.290
<b>I think it might be more fun to keep things secret, though.</b>

05:28.380 --> 05:30.290
<b>What do you think?</b>

05:30.460 --> 05:31.580
<b>Huh?</b>

05:39.500 --> 05:40.790
<b>Senzoku. Senzoku.</b>

05:40.790 --> 05:42.290
<b>Yeah, maybe.
</b><b>Senzoku. Senzoku.</b><b></b>

05:42.290 --> 05:44.710
<b>Yeah, maybe.</b>

05:44.710 --> 05:47.420
<b>I can hardly focus on a word she says!</b>

05:53.170 --> 05:54.580
<b>Someone's spoiled her!</b>

05:54.580 --> 05:55.330
<b>Oh, great...</b>

05:59.630 --> 06:01.210
<b>I'm sorry, Chii.</b>

06:01.670 --> 06:03.880
<b>No, I'M sorry!</b>

06:03.880 --> 06:04.500
<b>Huh?</b>

06:04.750 --> 06:12.000
<b>I was so focused on being on time since
I was in charge of our group that I didn't even notice.</b>

06:12.330 --> 06:13.580
<b>I'm really sorry...</b>

06:17.130 --> 06:18.420
<b>It's okay.</b>

06:18.630 --> 06:20.460
<b>All of us make mistakes sometimes.</b>

06:20.460 --> 06:22.250
<b>You're one to talk!</b>

06:26.630 --> 06:31.580
<b>Seriously, our workplace visit was a real mess.</b>

06:32.500 --> 06:36.960
<b>They were asking rude questions,
running off and getting split up...</b>

06:37.130 --> 06:39.380
<b>Airheads, the whole lot of 'em.</b>

06:39.710 --> 06:43.000
<b>Kyo-chan, you already told us all that yesterday.</b>

06:43.580 --> 06:46.630
<b>Y-yesterday I was telling mom!</b>

06:47.460 --> 06:48.670
<b>I better get going.</b>

06:48.670 --> 06:51.830
<b>Seems like you've been enjoying school lately.</b>

06:56.330 --> 06:57.420
<b>"Enjoying school"?</b>

06:58.000 --> 06:59.630
<b>Yeah, right.</b>

06:59.630 --> 07:02.000
<b>I still don't have any friends...</b>

07:09.500 --> 07:11.670
<b>Is it because I like Yamada?</b>

07:12.040 --> 07:16.250
<b>Like this gloomy little creep would read
anything as lighthearted as that!</b>

07:18.000 --> 07:20.040
<b>Can't let it go to my head.</b>

07:20.210 --> 07:22.630
<b>I know they're really just making fun of me.</b>

07:22.630 --> 07:25.000
<b>I'm the one who will end up hurt in the end.</b>

07:35.420 --> 07:36.670
<b>Good morning!</b>

07:36.830 --> 07:38.210
<b>Hey, good morning.</b>

07:38.880 --> 07:41.250
<b>Yamada? What are you doing out here?</b>

07:41.250 --> 07:43.250
<b>Nothing, just...</b>

07:43.460 --> 07:45.250
<b>She think she's a gym teacher or something?</b>

07:45.580 --> 07:47.500
<b>Is she waiting for someone?</b>

07:47.790 --> 07:49.500
<b>Guess that's got nothing to do with me.</b>

07:57.960 --> 07:59.580
<b>G-good morning!</b>

08:00.290 --> 08:01.920
<b>Y-yeah...</b>

08:02.290 --> 08:06.000
<b>That was close.
I wouldn't have spotted you if not for the bike.</b>

08:06.170 --> 08:07.500
<b>Y-yeah...</b>

08:13.000 --> 08:14.210
<b>So...</b>

08:15.250 --> 08:16.170
<b>Here.</b>

08:15.250 --> 08:17.170
<b>Kimi-iro Octave</b>

08:16.420 --> 08:17.170
<b>Huh?</b>

08:17.460 --> 08:19.080
<b>I told you I'd lend them to you.</b>

08:21.380 --> 08:22.460
<b>Don't you want to read them?</b>

08:22.630 --> 08:24.580
<b>She was serious about all that?</b>

08:24.670 --> 08:25.670
<b>Kimi-iro Octave</b>

08:25.000 --> 08:26.500
<b>N-no, I do...</b>

08:27.130 --> 08:29.330
<b>Why now, though?</b>

08:29.580 --> 08:32.880
<b>I'm leaving early today,
so I can't go to the library.</b>

08:33.040 --> 08:34.130
<b>Oh...</b>

08:34.420 --> 08:36.500
<b>It's super good!</b>

08:36.500 --> 08:37.830
<b>The main character's so great!</b>

08:37.830 --> 08:40.710
<b>Their friend dies at one point,
and a whole lot happens,</b>

08:40.710 --> 08:44.670
<b>but that cool looking guy on the back
cover turns out to be really sweet, and-</b>

08:44.830 --> 08:47.330
<b>Is it me or did you just spoil something huge?</b>

08:50.040 --> 08:54.330
<b>N-no, that's only like volume three,
right at the beginning, so-</b>

08:54.330 --> 08:55.630
<b>I've heard enough!</b>

09:00.580 --> 09:02.040
<b>Make sure you read it, okay?</b>

09:04.670 --> 09:06.500
<b>Hey, weren't you busy?</b>

09:06.750 --> 09:07.830
<b>With what?</b>

09:08.080 --> 09:10.710
<b>Waiting for someone at the front gate.</b>

09:13.330 --> 09:14.420
<b>Yeah...</b>

09:16.000 --> 09:16.880
<b>I was.</b>

09:17.460 --> 09:18.630
<b>Later, then...</b>

09:27.420 --> 09:28.630
<b>Library</b>

09:29.380 --> 09:33.540
<b>Yamada sometimes leaves early or stays
home from school for work reasons.</b>

09:35.460 --> 09:37.580
<b>Oh! You're sitting down, today!</b>

09:39.710 --> 09:41.210
<b>I thought you were leaving early?!</b>

09:41.460 --> 09:42.710
<b>Decided to swing by.</b>

09:43.630 --> 09:47.330
<b>Wait a minute, last time I told you to sit you said-</b>

09:47.830 --> 09:51.250
<b>N-no, it's easier to remember
stuff you read standing up...</b>

09:51.460 --> 09:53.040
<b>-didn't you?</b>

09:53.040 --> 09:54.290
<b>Oh, give me a break!</b>

09:54.500 --> 09:56.580
<b>Hey! That's not Kimi-Oct!</b>

09:57.670 --> 10:00.000
<b>I prefer to read manga at home.</b>

10:00.170 --> 10:01.250
<b>Read it now!</b>

10:01.670 --> 10:04.330
<b>T-this is a really grotesque book!</b>

10:04.630 --> 10:05.830
<b>Stop-</b>

10:14.710 --> 10:15.790
<b>Sorry...
</b><b> Sorry!</b><b></b>

10:16.750 --> 10:18.290
<b>No, I'm sorry.</b>

10:18.290 --> 10:20.000
<b>No, I am.</b>

10:20.670 --> 10:23.830
<b>I'd better go. Sorry!</b>

10:24.380 --> 10:25.670
<b>H-hey, umm...</b>

10:25.960 --> 10:26.750
<b>Huh?</b>

10:27.330 --> 10:29.790
<b>Wait, what did I call out to her, for?</b>

10:29.790 --> 10:32.330
<b>Uhh, umm...</b>

10:35.210 --> 10:37.750
<b>Are you gonna be in school tomorrow?</b>

10:37.830 --> 10:40.250
<b>W-what am I even asking?</b>

10:42.380 --> 10:44.580
<b>Mhmm. I will be.</b>

10:44.880 --> 10:47.330
<b>At the library, too. Without a doubt.</b>

10:50.750 --> 10:53.330
<b>Nothing in the world is without doubt...</b>

10:53.500 --> 10:55.040
<b>No need to be so serious.</b>

10:58.710 --> 11:03.960
<b>Kimi-iro Octave</b>

10:59.420 --> 11:02.790
<b>I guess maybe I do enjoy school.</b>

11:04.710 --> 11:06.830
<b>Kimi-iro Octave...</b>

11:07.670 --> 11:09.580
<b>I wonder how she usually reads.</b>

11:11.960 --> 11:13.080
<b>Like this?</b>

11:14.580 --> 11:15.880
<b>Or this?</b>

11:23.630 --> 11:25.880
<b>Like THAT!</b>

11:38.710 --> 11:39.540
<b>Did you read it?</b>

11:40.460 --> 11:43.500
<b>N-not yet.</b>

11:43.710 --> 11:46.380
<b>I couldn't concentrate on it yesterday.</b>

11:46.710 --> 11:49.040
<b>If you don't hurry,
I'm gonna spoil it all for you!</b>

11:49.040 --> 11:50.830
<b>You spoiled enough already!</b>

11:54.500 --> 11:57.170
<b>Can't just go reading it in class, either.</b>

11:57.420 --> 12:00.830
<b>Daijuni Junior High</b>

11:57.420 --> 12:00.830
<b>Kyotaro Ichikawa</b>

11:57.420 --> 12:00.830
<b>Kimi-iro Octave</b>

11:59.880 --> 12:00.790
<b>Ichikawa.</b>

12:03.040 --> 12:07.250
<b>What the hell are you doing just
talking to Yamada like that?</b>

12:07.540 --> 12:08.960
<b>Shoot!</b>

12:09.250 --> 12:11.540
<b>What? Aren't we classmates?</b>

12:11.540 --> 12:13.250
<b>Don't you two seem a little close?</b>

12:13.250 --> 12:15.210
<b>N-no we-</b>

12:15.630 --> 12:18.040
<b>Finally turned to bullying, has he?</b>

12:18.580 --> 12:21.670
<b>Think Yamada's got a crush on anyone?</b>

12:23.330 --> 12:27.920
<b>I mean, forget a crush, I bet she's got a boyfriend.</b>

12:28.290 --> 12:32.290
<b>But, not like I really care or anything.</b>

12:32.500 --> 12:34.330
<b>I-is he trying to open up to me?</b>

12:34.540 --> 12:38.130
<b>I figured if you two were close, maybe you'd know.</b>

12:38.130 --> 12:39.580
<b>Do ya?</b>

12:39.580 --> 12:41.290
<b>Uhh, no...</b>

12:41.710 --> 12:44.080
<b>I DO know she doesn't have one.</b>

12:44.290 --> 12:48.500
<b>Oh well. Don't you go telling anyone I asked.</b>

12:48.710 --> 12:50.380
<b>R-right...</b>

12:50.750 --> 12:53.580
<b>P-pretty crazy going for Yamada, though.</b>

12:53.790 --> 12:55.290
<b>True.</b>

12:55.750 --> 12:56.750
<b>But...</b>

12:57.170 --> 12:59.580
<b>Can't help who we like, right?</b>

13:00.580 --> 13:01.880
<b>True...</b>

13:01.880 --> 13:03.750
<b>Talk about embarrassing, though!</b>

13:04.290 --> 13:06.500
<b>When did it start?</b>

13:06.500 --> 13:09.380
<b>I guess I only noticed recently.</b>

13:10.080 --> 13:12.210
<b>When, exactly?</b>

13:12.210 --> 13:15.790
<b>I mean, if you really want to know, well...</b>

13:16.130 --> 13:18.790
<b>This is pretty embarrassing to put out there.</b>

13:18.790 --> 13:21.130
<b>But I stopped being able to wank to her.</b>

13:21.250 --> 13:22.880
<b>I never should have asked...</b>

13:23.210 --> 13:26.630
<b>They say you can't wank to the girls you really like.</b>

13:26.630 --> 13:28.380
<b>Turns out it's true!</b>

13:29.630 --> 13:30.500
<b>What?</b>

13:30.500 --> 13:32.000
<b>Huh? No, nothing...</b>

13:32.250 --> 13:33.540
<b>So like, that's where feelings get real, y'know?</b>

13:33.540 --> 13:34.710
<b>Is that true?
</b><b>So like, that's where feelings get real, y'know?</b><b></b>

13:34.710 --> 13:35.000
<b>So like, that's where feelings get real, y'know?</b>

13:35.000 --> 13:38.290
<b>Does that mean I don't really like her, then?
</b><b>So like, that's where feelings get real, y'know?</b><b></b>

13:38.290 --> 13:40.130
<b>Is she just some sexual fantasy?</b>

13:40.250 --> 13:42.250
<b>Yo, you even listening?</b>

13:42.960 --> 13:45.580
<b>W-what do you like about her?</b>

13:45.710 --> 13:48.630
<b>What? Are you blind or something?</b>

13:49.000 --> 13:50.460
<b>Her face, then?</b>

13:50.630 --> 13:51.960
<b>What else is there?</b>

13:51.960 --> 13:53.500
<b>There's plenty!</b>

13:53.750 --> 13:56.290
<b>She's got a nice figure, too.</b>

13:56.290 --> 13:58.790
<b>That's still just how she looks.</b>

13:59.000 --> 14:01.460
<b>She's got a nice rack, but those legs!</b>

14:01.460 --> 14:06.790
<b>Thin, but still nice and plump in that real hot sorta way.</b>

14:07.330 --> 14:09.000
<b>I'm heading back.</b>

14:10.130 --> 14:14.380
<b>Hey, listen though.
You better not tell anyone else!</b>

14:17.750 --> 14:20.330
<b>Why do I feel so gross?</b>

14:20.750 --> 14:26.080
<b>It only used to irk me a little
when they'd talk dirty about her.</b>

14:26.670 --> 14:29.040
<b>I've eyed her up plenty myself.</b>

14:29.380 --> 14:31.710
<b>Why does it bother me now?</b>

14:32.710 --> 14:36.250
<b>Wow, how did you know what she was saying?</b>

14:36.250 --> 14:38.380
<b>Just guessing with context.</b>

14:38.920 --> 14:39.290
<b>Wow.</b>

14:39.290 --> 14:39.830
<b>Is this feeling a sign I really like her?
</b><b>Wow.</b><b></b>

14:39.830 --> 14:42.960
<b>Is this feeling a sign I really like her?
</b><b>I mean, I'm just guessing!</b><b></b>

14:44.830 --> 14:46.500
<b>I just kinda have a hunch.</b>

14:46.500 --> 14:48.080
<b>That's Bayashi-Ko for you.</b>

14:48.500 --> 14:51.420
<b>Okay, quiz time. What am I saying?</b>

14:51.710 --> 14:53.630
<b>"Hohefuhorohohefu"</b>

14:53.880 --> 14:54.540
<b>Huh?</b>

14:55.750 --> 14:56.830
<b>What was that?
</b><b>Wait, what?</b><b></b>

14:59.040 --> 15:00.710
<b>"Hohefuhorohohefu"</b>

15:00.710 --> 15:01.830
<b>Bingo!</b>

15:01.960 --> 15:03.210
<b>What does that even mean?</b>

15:04.460 --> 15:05.420
<b>That's it?</b>

15:05.420 --> 15:07.130
<b>That's it, I guess!</b>

15:07.380 --> 15:08.040
<b>Right?</b>

15:08.040 --> 15:10.210
<b>Don't "right" me!</b>

15:11.330 --> 15:16.420
<b>I guess I really am looking at her that sorta way.</b>

15:16.960 --> 15:20.380
<b>Does that mean I don't actually like her?</b>

15:25.920 --> 15:28.790
<b>W-what am I gonna do...?</b>

15:29.330 --> 15:32.420
<b>No eating in the library</b>

15:29.330 --> 15:32.420
<b>Library Staff</b>

15:32.460 --> 15:38.460
<b>Best Borrowers</b>

15:32.460 --> 15:38.460
<b>1st 3-1 Omori - 13 books</b>

15:32.460 --> 15:38.460
<b>2nd 1-3 Hayasaka - 9 books</b>

15:32.460 --> 15:38.460
<b>3rd 2-2 Kamezaki - 7 books</b>

15:32.460 --> 15:38.460
<b>No eating in the library</b>

15:32.460 --> 15:38.460
<b>Library Staff</b>

15:32.460 --> 15:38.460
<b>Quiet in</b>

15:32.470 --> 15:38.460
<b>the Library!</b>

15:32.540 --> 15:35.040
<b>I can't snack anymore...</b>

15:35.040 --> 15:38.330
<b>Talk about getting serious over snacks.</b>

15:38.540 --> 15:41.250
<b>This sign wasn't up before, right?</b>

15:41.630 --> 15:43.750
<b>Now that you mention it, no.</b>

15:44.080 --> 15:47.250
<b>But it's obvious you can't eat in the library.</b>

15:47.500 --> 15:49.210
<b>That's what I mean!</b>

15:51.380 --> 15:55.080
<b>If it's so obvious, why post this now?</b>

15:55.250 --> 15:57.380
<b>No one eats here.</b>

15:59.290 --> 16:00.960
<b>Hang on a minute!</b>

16:02.830 --> 16:04.210
<b>Was that a Yamada joke?</b>

16:04.960 --> 16:11.170
<b>I'm just saying, someone must know I eat in here.</b>

16:11.330 --> 16:12.750
<b>Maybe.</b>

16:13.080 --> 16:15.250
<b>Gotta figure out who ratted you out.</b>

16:16.210 --> 16:22.830
<b>The only people who know are Kobayashi,
Sekine, Yoshida, Hara, Kanzaki, Kanaoya...</b>

16:23.040 --> 16:25.460
<b>L-let's not go down that line!</b>

16:25.460 --> 16:27.920
<b>Plenty of other people have been in here, too!</b>

16:27.920 --> 16:29.420
<b>Doesn't like to stir up trouble, huh?</b>

16:29.460 --> 16:35.170
<b>Best Borrowers</b>

16:29.460 --> 16:35.170
<b>1st 3-1 Omori - 13 books</b>

16:29.460 --> 16:35.170
<b>2nd 1-3 Hayasaka - 9 books</b>

16:29.460 --> 16:35.170
<b>3rd 2-2 Kamezaki - 7 books</b>

16:29.460 --> 16:35.170
<b>No eating in the library</b>

16:29.460 --> 16:35.170
<b>Library Staff</b>

16:29.460 --> 16:35.170
<b>Quiet in</b>

16:29.470 --> 16:35.170
<b>the Library!</b>

16:30.040 --> 16:33.500
<b>Let's go ask the library teacher about this sign.</b>

16:38.420 --> 16:44.830
<b>Now that I think of it,
they saw that snack bag in the trash before, right?</b>

16:45.290 --> 16:46.830
<b>Think that's why?</b>

16:46.830 --> 16:51.460
<b>That doesn't make sense though.
I really never threw anything away in there.</b>

16:51.790 --> 16:52.460
<b>Then...</b>

16:52.960 --> 16:56.130
<b>Maybe someone else is behind all this...</b>

16:56.500 --> 16:58.040
<b>I doubt that...</b>

17:00.080 --> 17:01.830
<b>That one WASN'T a joke?</b>

17:02.040 --> 17:04.210
<b>Teacher's Room</b>

17:02.460 --> 17:04.000
<b>Oh, that new sign?</b>

17:04.330 --> 17:08.750
<b>I-I thought it was weird there was a
sign for something so obvious.</b>

17:08.960 --> 17:10.710
<b>I found this on the floor.</b>

17:09.290 --> 17:10.880
<b>Honey Throat Drop</b>

17:12.210 --> 17:17.130
<b>It might just be one little lozenge,
but if we allow this, there's no stopping to it.</b>

17:17.630 --> 17:20.960
<b>Sometimes people don't realize the
obvious until we write it out for them.</b>

17:23.130 --> 17:25.500
<b>Hey, don't you have something to say?</b>

17:27.920 --> 17:29.420
<b>Say something!</b>

17:33.420 --> 17:35.080
<b>Does this mean...</b>

17:35.920 --> 17:40.830
<b>Is this the last day Yamada will come to the library?</b>

17:41.830 --> 17:47.290
<b>I guess she has no reason to be here if she can't eat.</b>

17:47.460 --> 17:55.670
<b>MURDER</b>

17:47.460 --> 17:55.670
<b>ENCYLOPEDIA</b>

17:47.880 --> 17:50.790
<b>Well, not like I care.</b>

17:51.040 --> 17:55.210
<b>She only talked to me because
I just happened to be here, anyway.</b>

17:57.080 --> 17:57.960
<b>Wait!</b>

17:59.830 --> 18:05.380
<b>I knew all along we couldn't eat here,
so one little sign doesn't change anything.</b>

18:05.750 --> 18:08.170
<b>What's with this girl?</b>

18:08.170 --> 18:10.750
<b>I knew the risks from the start!</b>

18:11.170 --> 18:13.080
<b>Quit trying to make it sound cool.</b>

18:13.080 --> 18:16.210
<b>If the library teacher catches you, you'll-</b>

18:26.130 --> 18:27.420
<b>Even still...</b>

18:32.000 --> 18:33.960
<b>I</b>

18:32.500 --> 18:33.330
<b>I-</b>

18:37.880 --> 18:38.830
<b>...still...</b>

18:45.750 --> 18:47.170
<b>...like her...</b>

18:51.670 --> 18:52.670
<b>...so much!</b>

18:57.170 --> 18:58.630
<b>Melted It</b>

19:11.380 --> 19:13.420
<b>That was close...</b>

19:16.880 --> 19:19.630
<b>W-was that too weird for her?</b>

19:21.330 --> 19:23.040
<b>S-sorry...</b>

19:23.290 --> 19:27.170
<b>I thought she might take them away
or even kick you out for good...</b>

19:32.040 --> 19:33.080
<b>Did it melt?</b>

19:33.080 --> 19:34.330
<b>You should wash your hands.</b>

19:36.170 --> 19:37.380
<b>Go away...</b>

19:57.670 --> 19:58.750
<b>You know...</b>

20:01.080 --> 20:04.500
<b>You should lay off the snacks...</b>

20:04.960 --> 20:06.000
<b>Seriously.</b>

20:07.630 --> 20:08.380
<b>Yeah...</b>

20:12.170 --> 20:17.080
<b>Library</b>

20:13.960 --> 20:15.500
<b>This is how it should be.</b>

20:15.880 --> 20:16.920
<b>Over with.</b>

20:18.250 --> 20:19.630
<b>All of it.</b>

20:34.630 --> 20:38.080
<b>I-I thought I'd do my homework.</b>

20:39.080 --> 20:41.000
<b>Y-yeah?</b>

20:48.630 --> 20:52.460
<b>I'm laying off the snacks! A whole third of them!</b>

20:52.790 --> 20:56.250
<b>Library</b>

20:53.420 --> 20:55.790
<b>The problem wasn't the amount...</b>

20:56.830 --> 21:00.330
<b>Yamada never changes.</b>

21:00.670 --> 21:03.960
<b>I Melted It</b>

22:34.790 --> 22:39.130
<b>Who could have thrown
something away in here, though?</b>

22:39.290 --> 22:40.330
<b>Wasn't it you?</b>

22:40.460 --> 22:41.290
<b>What?!</b>

22:41.670 --> 22:43.670
<b>Remember way back?</b>

22:52.250 --> 22:53.920
<b>No, I...</b>

22:54.040 --> 22:55.460
<b>...never threw that away.</b>

22:55.710 --> 22:57.210
<b>What? Why?</b>

22:57.210 --> 22:58.460
<b>Well...</b>

22:58.460 --> 22:59.380
<b>It's just trash, you know.</b>

22:59.380 --> 23:00.830
<b>No, uhh...</b>

23:00.830 --> 23:01.960
<b>You brought it home?</b>

23:02.380 --> 23:03.040
<b>Why?</b>

23:03.040 --> 23:04.080
<b>Why??</b>
